    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack present to the market 96 Highfield Manor, nestled within the ever-popular development, No. 96 is a beautifully presented four-bedroom, semi-detached residence offering spacious, light-filled accommodation in excellent turn-key condition. This superb family home has been exceptionally well maintained making it an ideal choice for growing families, first-time buyers or investors alike\n\nThe property extends to a generous layout with a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room, guest WC, and a bright open-plan kitchen/dining area overlooking the private rear garden. Upstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish family bathroom. There is also an attached garage, \n\nPresented in excellent decorative order throughout, the home benefits from quality finishes, generous living space and an enclosed rear garden ideal for outdoor entertaining or family life.\n\nHighfield Manor is a mature, family-friendly development located on the outskirts of Carlow Town, just minutes from Graiguecullen and within easy reach of schools, shops, sporting facilities and all local amenities. The nearby Northern Relief Road provides excellent connectivity to Dublin, Kilkenny, Waterford and Wexford, making this an ideal location for commuters. The estate has long been recognised as a popular residential development for families seeking convenience and accessibility.\n\nNo. 96 represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a spacious, four-bedroom family home in one of Graiguecullen's most sought-after residential developments. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
